99936000</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><span class=\"text-2xl text-[#D4AF37]\">✉️</span><div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-[bg-desert-text]\">Email</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-stone-600\">jagdishdunepalace@gmail.com</p></div></div></div><form class=\"space-y-5 bg-white p-8 border border-stone-200 shadow-sm rounded-sm\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-serif mb-2 text-[bg-desert-text]\">Send a Message</h3><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Your Full Name\" class=\"w-full bg-[#faf8f5] border border-stone-200 px-4 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#D4AF37]\" required=\"\"/><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Your Email\" class=\"w-full bg-[#faf8f5] border border-stone-200 px-4 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#D4AF37]\" required=\"\"/><input type=\"tel\" placeholder=\"Your Phone Number\" class=\"w-full bg-[#faf8f5] border border-stone-200 px-4 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#D4AF37]\" required=\"\"/><textarea placeholder=\"How can we help you?\" class=\"w-full bg-[#faf8f5] border border-stone-200 px-4 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#D4AF37] h-32\" required=\"\"></textarea><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full bg-[bg-desert-text] text-[#D4AF37] hover:bg-[#D4AF37] hover:text-[bg-desert-text] py-4 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm transition-colors\">Submit Message</button></form></div><div class=\"flex flex-col h-full\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-serif mb-6 text-[bg-desert-text]\">Our Location</h3><p class=\"text-stone-600 mb-6\">Find us easily on Google Maps. Click the button below to get directions directly to our hotel.</p><div class=\"flex-grow w-full min-h-[400px] border-4 border-[#D4AF37] shadow-lg mb-6 relative\"><iframe src=\"https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Jagdish%20Dune%20Palace%20Chohtan%20Barmer%20Rajasthan&amp;t=&amp;z=14&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;iwloc=&amp;output=embed\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" style=\"border:0;position:absolute;top:0;left:0\" allowFullScreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerPolicy=\"no-referrer-when-